From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dev <dev@local>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 23:00:00 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 02/18] feat(editor): font, size and color; bundled Persian web fonts
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

VERSION: 2.0 (2026-10-12)  2.0 = merged set of 11 patches (old numbers below)
Root: build/outline-1.11.0 (apply after 0001)

Font, font size and text color (was 0004 v1.0):
- New text_style mark with optional fontFamily, fontSize and color, written
  as an inline style built only from whitelisted values (no arbitrary CSS).
- Formatting toolbar: Font, Font size and Text color submenus.
- The Font button shows the font of the selected text. Font names are
  localized from public/fonts/names.json (e.g. Vazirmatn in Persian); a
  font without a name for the language keeps its own name.
- Font and size follow the interface direction.
- Fonts not bundled with the app (Tahoma, Arial, Times New Roman, Georgia,
  Courier New) are kept as legacy values so existing text still renders,
  but are not offered in the menu.
- Pasted styles are kept only when they match a menu value (no fixed black
  text from word processors in the dark theme); spans written by the editor
  keep every value. Not exported to Markdown (no syntax).

Bundled Persian web fonts (was 0005 v1.0):
- @font-face rules for Vazirmatn (variable), Sahel, Shabnam, Samim and
  Parastoo, one rule per real weight file (no synthesized bold).
- The .woff2 files (SIL OFL) are not part of the patch: install.sh (step 4)
  unzips them from assets/fonts.zip into public/fonts/.

Files (10; N = new, M = modified, D = deleted):
  N app/components/Icons/TextStyleIcon.tsx
  M app/editor/menus/formatting.tsx
  N app/utils/fontNames.ts
  N public/fonts/names.json
  M server/static/index.html
  N shared/editor/marks/TextStyle.ts
  M shared/editor/nodes/index.ts
  N shared/editor/queries/getTextStyle.ts
  N shared/utils/textStyle.test.ts
  N shared/utils/textStyle.ts

